# Expanding AI Tool Access & Canvas Data

The user wants the AI to have full access to Canvas data (materials, announcements, etc.) and more CRUD operations. 

## Proposed Changes

### [AI Tools Component]

#### [MODIFY] [ai_tools.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py)
- **Enhanced Tools**:
    - [search_announcements(...)](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#197-234): Now returns the full `message_html` (stripped of HTML tags for the LLM) to allow the AI to actually read the content of announcements.
    - [get_courses()](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#172-179): Include more summary data.
- **New Tools**:
    - [search_module_materials(query: str, course_code: Optional[str] = None)](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#235-279): Uses the **RAG Service** to search inside the *contents* of uploaded files, Canvas documents, and synced materials. This is the "everything" access.
    - [get_module_details(course_code: str)](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#288-309): Returns rich metadata from the [Course](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/models/course.py#38-65) model.
    - [create_note(...)](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#144-170), [update_note(...)](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#171-196), [delete_task(...)](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#446-460): CRUD operations.
    - [create_timetable_event(...)](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#342-367), [delete_timetable_event(...)](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#523-540): Sanitized timetable tools.

#### [MODIFY] [canvas_sync.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/canvas_sync.py)
- **New Sync Functions**:
    - `sync_files(session, user_id, course_id, canvas_id, api_token)`: Fetches file metadata from Canvas API.
    - `download_canvas_file(file_record, api_token)`: Downloads the file to local storage.
    - `index_files(session, user_id, course_id)`: Extracts text (PDF/PPT/Docx) and pushes to **RAG Service**.
- **Update [sync_all](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/canvas_sync.py#356-440)**: Integrate `sync_files` and indexing into the main sync loop.

#### [MODIFY] [ai_tools.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py)
- **Enhanced Tools**:
    - [search_announcements(...)](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#197-234): Already returning `message_text`.
    - [search_module_materials(...)](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#235-279): Uses **RAG Service** to search inside the *contents* of downloaded Canvas files. (Verified working, but needs data).

